{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28044","headline":"和白敏中圣德和平致兹休运岁终功就合咏盛明呈上 · 魏扶","name":"和白敏中圣德和平致兹休运岁终功就合咏盛明呈上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧关新复旧山川，古戍秦原景象鲜。\n戎虏乞降归惠化，皇威渐被慑腥膻。\n穹庐远戍烟尘灭，神武光扬竹帛传。\n左袵尽知謌帝泽，从兹不更备三边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏扶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}